ulty. B strong on reliability and stress but communication issues. D strong on responsibility and problem solving but poor crew cooperation. A strong technical but reliability and adaptability concerns.\n\nThus C likely best overall. I should reaffirm vote for C, referencing A's concerns and D's concerns, and comparing with B. Also note that while C has communication difficulty, his positive crew atmosphere suggests he can manage teamwork. So I will maintain recommendation for C.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: I will say I still recommend C, referencing new info on A and D, and comparing with B. Provide evidence.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: vote Candidate C."}
